column name : potential usage  
• "repo_name" (GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.GITHUB_REPOS.LICENSES) : repository identifier to be joined with the event table.  
• "license"    (GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.GITHUB_REPOS.LICENSES) : filter to “approved” SPDX‑style licenses that appear in licenses.md.  
• "type"       (GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.YEAR."_2022")            : classify each 2022 GitHub event (ForkEvent, WatchEvent, IssuesEvent …).  
• "created_at" (GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.YEAR."_2022")            : epoch‑style timestamp; restrict to April 2022 (2022‑04‑01 – 2022‑04‑30).  
• "repo"       (GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.YEAR."_2022")            : VARIANT that contains the attribute "name" → repository slug used for joins.  
• "payload"    (GITHUB_REPOS_DATE.YEAR."_2022")            : JSON string; “action” field can further refine issues vs pull‑requests if necessary.  

